  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "OpenccNetLib v1.6.0\n\n            - Added s2hkp / hk2sp Hong Kong phrase conversion.\n            - Added HKPhrases, HKPhrasesRev, TWVariantsPhrases, and HKVariantsPhrases dictionary slots.\n            - Added DeTofu support with custom fallback mappings and files.\n            - Updated s2twp and regional variant conversion chains to match upstream OpenCC.\n            - Synced Japanese Shinjitai dictionary topology with upstream OpenCC (93ee7f7).\n            - Added jps_characters_rev and retired legacy JPVariants/JPVariantsRev plans.\n            - Improved dictionary loading, serialization, compatibility, tests, and documentation.\n\n            Breaking: custom dictionary bundles must include jps_characters_rev; regenerate custom JSON/CBOR/Zstd bundles for v1.6.0.",
